<article class="page">
  <header>
    <h1>Projects</h1>
    <p class="lede"><strong>I did not found companies alongside my research.</strong></p>
    <p class="lede">I built the instruments the research required and that did not exist: a platform
       to measure mobility behaviour at urban scale, a laboratory to experiment in real cities,
       a production company to carry the results outside the academy.</p>
  </header>

  <section aria-labelledby="muv">
    <h2 id="muv">MUV B Corp <span class="when">since 2020</span></h2>
    <p>A digital game played in the real world. It rewards walking, cycling, scooters and public
       transport, reframing sustainable mobility as a competitive sport: citizens are athletes,
       city governments are coaches, companies are sponsors. It measures the CO<sub>2</sub> people
       avoid with an algorithm certified by RINA to ISO 14064-II. A University of Palermo academic
       spin-off since March 2025.</p>
    <dl class="facts">
      <dt>Founders</dt><dd>I founded it with <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/domenicoschillaci/">Domenico Schillaci</a>, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/francescomassa/">Francesco Massa</a>, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/robertofilippi/">Roberto Filippi</a> and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ugoparodigiusino/">Ugo Parodi Giusino</a>.</dd>
      <dt>Role</dt><dd>Co-Founder · Scientific Director. CEO from January to December 2020.</dd>
      <dt>For the research</dt><dd>Primary longitudinal data on mobility behaviour in over 25 cities,
        behind much of my recent work. It grew out of the Horizon 2020 project MUV2020.</dd>
      <dt>Results</dt><dd>A 33.8% average reduction in CO<sub>2</sub> among participants.</dd>
      <dt>Recognition</dt><dd>MOST Prize 2025 (€200,000) · ADI Design Index 2020 · Better Together
        Award 2019 (German Federal Ministry for the Environment) · EIT Urban Mobility accelerator 2020.</dd>
    </dl>
    <p><a href="https://www.muvgame.com/">muvgame.com</a> · <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/muv-game/">MUV on LinkedIn</a></p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="push">
    <h2 id="push">PUSH <span class="when">since 2013</span></h2>
    <p>A non-profit design lab for urban and social innovation, in Palermo. Research at the
       intersection of design, social science and digital technology, in a field chosen on
       purpose: marginal contexts.</p>
    <dl class="facts">
      <dt>Founders</dt><dd>I founded it with my friends <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/domenicoschillaci/">Domenico Schillaci</a>, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/francescomassa/">Francesco Massa</a>, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/robertofilippi/">Roberto Filippi</a> and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/filippimauro/">Mauro Filippi</a>.</dd>
      <dt>Direction</dt><dd>Today PUSH is run by <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/emilia-pardi-206029117/">Emilia Pardi</a> and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/alessandroriv4/">Alessandro Riva</a>.</dd>
      <dt>Role</dt><dd>Co-Founder · Scientific Director. President and Managing Director from 2013 to 2022.</dd>
      <dt>For the research</dt><dd>The living lab where action research happens. Between 2013 and 2020:
        over €5M in applied research funding, 20 funded and 22 self-funded projects, 32 scientific
        articles. Six editions of the Urban Thinkers Campus with UN-Habitat, from 2015 to 2023.</dd>
      <dt>Now</dt><dd>Madonie Living Lab, open innovation in Sicily's inland areas.</dd>
    </dl>
    <p><a href="https://www.wepush.org/">wepush.org</a> · <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/wepush/">PUSH on LinkedIn</a></p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="piranesi">
    <h2 id="piranesi">The Piranesi Experience <span class="when">since 2013</span></h2>
    <p>An independent production company for documentaries on cities, art, architecture and
       sustainable development. The first company in southern Italy to receive Slate Development
       support from Creative Europe MEDIA, in 2023.</p>
    <dl class="facts">
      <dt>Founders</dt><dd>I founded it with <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/claudiopiranesi/">Claudio Esposito</a>, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/domenicoschillaci/">Domenico Schillaci</a>, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/francescomassa/">Francesco Massa</a> and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/robertofilippi/">Roberto Filippi</a>.</dd>
      <dt>Role</dt><dd>Co-Founder and Advisor.</dd>
      <dt>For the research</dt><dd>Dissemination: the voice that carries results beyond academic
        circles. <cite>Samia: Little Dreamer</cite> (Tribeca Film Festival 2024, Special Mention), <cite>Terra Nova</cite>
        (Torino Film Festival 2023), <cite>Far From Maine</cite> (IFFR Rotterdam 2026).</dd>
    </dl>
    <p><a href="https://www.piranesiexperience.com/">piranesiexperience.com</a> · <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/thepiranesiexperience/">The Piranesi Experience on LinkedIn</a></p>
  </section>

